  "hashAlgorithm": "blake2b-256",
  "body": {
    "summary": "We have determined that this Treasury Withdrawal governance action is unconstitutional.",
    "rationaleStatement": "Article II, Section 6(1) of the Cardano Constitution states \"To ensure transparency in on-chain governance, proposed governance actions shall follow a standardized and legible format before being recorded or enacted on-chain. This format shall include a URL hosting a document that outlines additional context for the proposed governance action, and the hash of this document. The document hosted by such a URL shall be immutable and incapable of being altered after submission, and the content of every on-chain Governance Action must be identical to the final off-chain version of the proposed action.”\r\n\r\nThe governance action with ID \"gov_action1dmwlfuwm45r0x2d2d96r2kwyjv9hk6ylzmq8xpsay2xecesn6xwqqdlv55z\" and title “Cardano Strategic Copper Reserve | ₳22M RWA Tokenization” included a metadata document URL of https://totofinance.com/cardano-treasury-proposal-strategic-tokenized-copper-reserve/data.jsonld, which is not immutable.\r\n\r\nWe therefore find this governance action **Unconstitutional**.",
    "precedentDiscussion": "None",
    "counterargumentDiscussion": "None",
    "conclusion": "This governance action does not fulfil all the requirements for governance actions specified in the Cardano Constitution, so is deemed unconstitutional.",
    "internalVote": {
      "constitutional": 0,
      "unconstitutional": 5,
      "abstain": 2,
      "didNotVote": 0
    },
    "references": []
  },
